  },
  "_source_status": "AFND frequencies retrieved from MIT-licensed mirror",
  "_method": "pooled af = sum(copies)/sum(2N); Wilson 95% CI; carrier = 1-(1-af)^2; coverage = 1-prod(1-af)^2; coverage CI propagated from per-allele Wilson bounds (approximate). Regional split: AFND population label -> country (longest-name match) -> UN M49 sub-region.",
  "_region_mapping": {
    "scheme": "UN M49 sub-region (ISO 3166), sourced; approximates IEDB's geographic-area breakdown (IEDB's own area table is not reproducibly CI-fetchable). Unassigned populations are pooled separately and still counted in the GLOBAL figures.",
